# PIOS — Personal Investment Operating System
# 公开仓库。提交项目入口与规则正文；不提交本机权限、密钥、个人持仓与生产决策/报告。

# --- OS & editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/

# VS Code: ignore local cache; keep shared project settings
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json

# Cursor：提交 rules（指向 AGENTS.md）与 skills（发现层）；忽略本机缓存
.cursor/*.log
.cursor/debug.log

# Claude Code：提交根目录 CLAUDE.md；不提交本机权限
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json

# --- SpecStory (session history, stats) ---
.specstory/

# --- Python (future scripts) ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Node (defensive) ---
node_modules/
dist/
.npm/

# --- Environment & secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
credentials.json
secrets/
private/

# --- 公开仓库：个人生产数据不入库；demo 可入库 ---
database/portfolio/holdings.csv
decision_log/**
!decision_log/.gitkeep
!decision_log/README.md
!decision_log/demo/
!decision_log/demo/**
reports/**
!reports/.gitkeep
!reports/demo/
!reports/demo/**

# Local-only notes overrides
*.local.md

# --- Temporary & cache ---
*.tmp
*.bak
.cache/

# Excel lock files
~$*.xlsx
~$*.xls
